{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Capacity Forecast.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Capacity Forecast.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai capacity forecast ai capacity forecast","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Capacity Forecast.md","fileName":"AI Capacity Forecast.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Capacity Forecast","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Network Monitoring and Remediation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Network Monitoring and Remediation","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Capacity Forecast.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Capacity Forecast.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai capacity forecast ai capacity forecast","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Capacity Forecast.md","fileName":"AI Capacity Forecast.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Capacity Forecast","heading":"AI Capacity Forecast","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"An AI capacity forecast uses recent time-series data to describe whether device utilization appears to be approaching a limit over a stated horizon. It can identify recurring peaks, list devices needing attention, and explain the assumptions behind an expected trend.\n\nThe forecast should not present a language model's narrative as a calibrated statistical prediction. Thresholds, horizon, and source window must remain visible, and conventional forecasting or additional history may be needed for quantitative commitments. Capacity decisions require confirmation with live data and known demand changes.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Network Monitoring and Remediation","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Capacity Forecast.md::2","sourceKe